{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57196","headline":"十四科头 事理不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 事理不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心王自在翛然，法性本无十缠。\n一切无非佛事，何须摄念坐禅。\n妄想本来空寂，不用断除攀缘。\n智者无心口得，自然无争无喧。\n不识无爲大道，何时得证幽玄。\n佛与衆生一种，衆生即是世尊。\n凡夫妄生分别，无中执有迷奔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}